{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "1CH",
  "chapter": 13,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "1CH.13.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.13.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And David consulted with the captains of thousands, and of hundreds, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with every leader.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.13.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.13.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And David said to all the congregation of Israel, If ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it seemeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " good to you, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the LORD our God, let us send abroad to our brethren every where, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " left in all the land of Israel, and with them ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "also",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to the priests and Levites ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "who are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in their cities ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " suburbs, that they may assemble to us:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.13.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.13.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And let us bring again to us the ark of our God: for we inquired not at it in the days of Saul.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.13.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.13.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And all the congregation said that they would do so: for the thing was right in the eyes of all the people.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.13.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.13.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So David assembled all Israel, from Shihor of Egypt even to the entrance of Hemath, to bring the ark of God from Kirjath-jearim.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.13.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.13.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And David went up, and all Israel, to Baalah, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", to Kirjath-jearim, which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "belonged",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to Judah, to bring up thence the ark of God the LORD, that dwelleth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "between",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the cherubim, whose name is called ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "on it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.13.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.13.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they carried the ark of God in a new cart out of the house of Abinadab: and Uzza and Ahio drove the cart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.13.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.13.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And David and all Israel played before God with all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " might, and with singing, and with harps, and with psalteries, and with timbrels, and with cymbals, and with trumpets.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.13.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.13.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And when they came to the threshing-floor of Chidon, Uzza put forth his hand to hold the ark; for the oxen stumbled.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.13.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.13.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the anger of the LORD was kindled against Uzza, and he smote him, because he put his hand to the ark: and there he died before God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.13.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.13.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And David was displeased, because the LORD had made a breach upon Uzza: wherefore that place is called Perez-uzza to this day.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.13.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.13.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And David was afraid of God that day, saying, How shall I bring the ark of God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "home",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to me?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.13.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.13.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So David brought not the ark to himself to the city of David, but carried it aside into the house of Obed-edom the Gittite.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CH.13.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CH.13.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the ark of God remained with the family of Obed-edom in his house three months. And the LORD blessed the house of Obed-edom, and all that he had.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
